# Downivo

Flutter Android (plus Flutter Web) download manager. Clean Architecture, feature packages, offline-first, Material Design 3.

## Source of truth

Before implementing features, consult `documentation/` — especially:

- `01_Project_Overview.md`
- `02_Product_Requirements_Document.md`
- `07_Engineering_Standards.md`
- `11_Technical_Architecture/`
- `12_System_Design/`

Implementation must follow these documents. Never contradict them.

## Scope

- Keep changes minimal and scoped to the feature or module being edited.
- Do not start new application features unless explicitly requested.
- Production-ready code only — no placeholder architecture or demo code unless requested.
- Prefer existing patterns in the codebase over new abstractions.

## Architecture

- Clean Architecture with feature-based modules
- Repository pattern, dependency injection, event bus
- Offline-first where practical

## GitHub

- Use GitHub MCP only when repo inspection, issues, or PRs are needed — not for routine local edits.
